# Security and Sensitive Data Handling Rules

## Purpose

These rules define how credentials, tokens, personal data, and other sensitive values must be handled across tests, logs, reports, failure artifacts, and visual checkpoints.

The goal is to prevent secrets and sensitive data from appearing in console output, Allure attachments, Playwright HTML reports, traces, failure screenshots, videos, CI artifacts, debug dumps, or git history.

Rule references (detail lives here; do not duplicate policy elsewhere):

- `.cursor/rules/configuration-secrets.rules.mdc` — env and config injection
- `.cursor/rules/diagnostics-reporting.rules.mdc` — actionable failures without leaking data
- `.cursor/rules/reporting-allure.mdc` — Allure attachment policy
- `.cursor/rules/visual-testing.mdc` — visual mask policy
- `.cursor/rules/test-data-generation.rules.mdc` — safe generated data
- `.cursor/rules/temporary-debug-artifact-cleanup.rules.mdc` — debug dump cleanup

Human guide:

- `docs/security-data-handling.md`

---

## Core Principle

**Protect by default.**

Assume failure artifacts and logs will be shared (CI artifacts, Allure, support tickets).

Never print, attach, or commit raw secrets.

Prefer prevention (safe data, no logging, masked screenshots) over post-hoc redaction of traces.

---

## Sensitive Data Classes

| Class | Examples | Console / logs | Assertion messages | Allure attach | Visual baseline | Failure screenshot / trace |
|-------|----------|----------------|-------------------|---------------|-----------------|---------------------------|
| **Secret** | password, API key, Bearer token, cookie value, storageState, `.env` | never | redact | never | always mask if visible | highest risk — avoid capturing state when possible |
| **PII / generated identity** | email, phone, name, address from generators | avoid; use `safeLogger` if needed | ok if not secret | sanitize | mask when generated / unstable | mask when filled forms are screenshot |
| **Session** | auth header, refresh token, session id | never | redact | never attach raw | mask token display fields | trace network is high risk |
| **Config** | env var **names** | ok | ok | ok (names only) | n/a | n/a |
| **Config value** | URL, non-secret host | ok (hosts only in Allure env) | ok | sanitize | n/a | n/a |

